   "idx": 4,
   "zh": "今晚，南海之滨灯火璀璨，鹏城深圳秋意盎然。在亚太经合组织第三十三次领导人非正式会议即将召开之际，我谨代表中国政府和中国人民，对各位嘉宾的到来表示热烈欢迎。",
   "en": "Tonight, the shores of the South China Sea are ablaze with light, and Shenzhen is at its autumn best. On the eve of the 33rd APEC Economic Leaders’ Meeting, I wish to extend, on behalf of the Chinese government and the Chinese people, our warmest welcome to all distinguished guests.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
