  },
  {
   "idx": 5,
   "zh": "我曾讲过，看千年的中国去西安，看五百年的中国去北京，看一百年的中国去上海。今天，我想对大家说，看五十年的中国就来深圳。",
   "en": "I have often said that to see over a few thousand years of China, go to Xi’an; to see 500 years of China, go to Beijing; to see 100 years of China, go to Shanghai. Tonight, let me add this: To see 50 years of China, come to Shenzhen.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    20,
    20
   ],
   "ep": [
    21,
    21
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 6,
   "zh": "深圳是一个有大故事的地方。1978年，我第一次到深圳，看到的还是一个小渔村。弹指间40多年过去了，如今这里高楼林立、车水马龙，变化之大可谓沧海桑田。",
   "en": "Shenzhen is a place with a big story to tell. When I first set foot here in 1978, it was little more than a fishing village. In the blink of an eye, more than four decades have passed. Today, high-rises stretch across the horizon and traffic surges through the streets—a transformation nothing short of miraculous.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    23,
    23
   ],
   "ep": [
    24,
    24
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 7,
   "zh": "开放是深圳与生俱来的基因。从边陲小镇到国际化大都市，从引进外资和技术到积极参与制定国际规则，今天的深圳，贸易联通四海，商旅络绎不绝，成为中国高水平对外开放的窗口。",
   "en": "Openness is in Shenzhen’s DNA. From a remote border town to an international metropolis, from merely attracting foreign capital and technology to actively helping shape international rules—Shenzhen today has trade links spanning the globe and welcomes an endless stream of businesspeople and travelers. It stands as a window on China’s high-standard opening up.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    26,
    26
   ],
   "ep": [
    27,
    27
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 8,
   "zh": "创新是深圳的活力所在。从出口加工到自主研发，从“世界工厂”到创新之城，今天的深圳，每年国际专利申请量近2万件，先进制造业和现代服务业比翼齐飞，成为中国集群式创新的前沿。",
   "en": "Innovation is the wellspring of Shenzhen’s vitality. From export processing to independent research and development, from “world factory” to “city of innovation”—Shenzhen today files up to 20,000 international patent applications a year. Advanced manufacturing and modern services flourish side by side, placing the city at the forefront of China’s cluster-based innovation.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    29,
    29
   ],
   "ep": [
    30,
    30
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 9,
   "zh": "合作是深圳的力量之源。“来了就是深圳人。”这座城市以宽广胸怀接纳四面八方的奋斗者，汇聚来自100多个国家和地区的国际化人才，成为中国同各方合作共赢的热土。",
   "en": "Cooperation is the source of Shenzhen’s strength. As the people of Shenzhen like to say, “Once here, Shenzhener forever.” The city opens its minds and arms to go-getters from around the world and brings together talent from over 100 countries and regions, making it a vibrant hub of win-win cooperation between China and the rest of the world.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    32,
    32
   ],
   "ep": [
    33,
    33
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 10,
   "zh": "深圳的故事是中国改革开放的缩影。一代代建设者在改革开放中破冰突围、接续奋斗，解放和发展生产力，展现了中国式现代化的万千气象。",
   "en": "The Shenzhen story is a microcosm of China’s reform and opening up. Generation after generation of builders have started from scratch and worked tirelessly to blaze new trails. They have forged ahead in reform and opening up, unleashed and developed the productive forces, and showcased the great dynamism of Chinese modernization.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    35,
    35
   ],
   "ep": [
    36,
    36
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 11,
   "zh": "深圳的故事也是亚太合作的成功范例。亚太经济体突破地理限制和观念差异，积极投入区域合作的大舞台，创造了经济快速发展的“亚太奇迹”。",
   "en": "The Shenzhen story is also a shining example of Asia-Pacific cooperation. Economies across the region have risen above geographic constraints and differences in thinking, thrown themselves into the wide arena of regional cooperation, and created the Asia-Pacific miracle of rapid economic growth.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
