  {
   "idx": 13,
   "zh": "亚太经合组织成立以来，开放、创新、合作一直是其鲜明标识。从西雅图的初次握手到雁栖湖的历史盛会，从茂物目标的庄严承诺到亚太共同体的宏伟愿景，亚太经合组织始终把握时代脉搏、引领亚太经济一体化进程，助力亚太成为全球经济最具活力的地区和重要增长引擎。",
   "en": "Since its founding, APEC has always been known for openness, innovation and cooperation. From the first handshake in Seattle to the historic gathering by Beijing’s Yanqi Lake, from the solemn commitment to the Bogor Goals to the broad vision of building an Asia-Pacific community—APEC has remained attuned to the pulse of our times, spearheaded economic integration in the Asia-Pacific, and helped make this region the most dynamic in the global economy and a vital engine of world growth.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    45,
    45
   ],
