    46
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 14,
   "zh": "于道各努力，千里自同风。为了建设亚太共同体，我们跨越山海走到一起。中方担任今年亚太经合组织东道主以来，在16座城市举办了300多场会议和活动，各成员经济体代表逾万人次踊跃参与，为“中国年”收获更多重要成果作出贡献。在明天的领导人会议上，我们将讨论扩大相互开放的举措，探索创新驱动增长的路径，拓展各领域务实合作的机遇，推动更多成果落地。我期待同大家共商亚太合作大计、共襄亚太发展大业。",
   "en": "“On separate sails, we give our best; even a thousand miles apart, the same wind connects our quest.” This verse captures perfectly why we have crossed mountains and seas to come together—united by the shared purpose of building an Asia-Pacific community. Since becoming the APEC Chair, China has hosted over 300 meetings and events across 16 cities in the course of the year, with more than 10,000 delegates from member economies taking part and helping to deliver significant outcomes during the APEC China Year. At tomorrow’s Leaders’ Meeting, we will discuss steps to expand mutual openness, explore pathways to innovation-driven growth, extend opportunities for result-oriented cooperation across various fields, and strive to deliver more tangible results on the ground. I look forward to discussing with you the great endeavor of Asia-Pacific cooperation and advancing our shared cause of Asia-Pacific development.",
   "kind": "para",
