   "idx": 15,
   "zh": "现在，我提议，让我们一起举杯， 为亚太地区的共同繁荣， 为这次领导人非正式会议圆满成功， 为各位嘉宾和家人的健康， 干杯！",
   "en": "Now, I would like to propose a toast. Let’s raise our glasses: To the shared prosperity of the Asia-Pacific; To the great success of the APEC Economic Leaders’ Meeting; and To the health of all distinguished guests and your families. Cheers!",
